exercises.instructions:
Write a function called `createDeck` that takes no arguments and returns an array of 52 card objects.

Each card object should have three properties:
- `suit`: one of `"hearts"`, `"diamonds"`, `"clubs"`, `"spades"`
- `rank`: one of `"2"` through `"10"`, `"J"`, `"Q"`, `"K"`, `"A"`
- `value`: numeric value (2-10 for number cards, 10 for J/Q/K, 11 for A)

Example:
```
createDeck()
// Returns: [
//   { suit: "hearts", rank: "2", value: 2 },
//   { suit: "hearts", rank: "3", value: 3 },
//   ...
//   { suit: "spades", rank: "A", value: 11 }
// ]
```

